OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over giant cable reel
OL,4,Acrash that blocked A77 in Ayrshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged over a lorry
OL,7,Fcrash that left the A77 in Ayrshire
OL,8,Fblocked for hours by giant cable reels.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to a "one vehicle crash" near
OL,12,FKilmarnock at around 13:30. There were
OL,13,Fno reported injuries.
OL,15,FPhotos shared on social media showed
OL,16,Ftraffic tailed back behind three giant
OL,17,Fmetal reels - with one caught on the
OL,18,Fcentre barrier near oncoming traffic.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
