OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over giant cable reel
OL,4,Acrash that blocked A77 in Ayrshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A77 and the B7073 London Road were
OL,7,Fclosed at the junction between Wellpark
OL,8,FAvenue and Billy Bowie Park until about
OL,9,F18:45.
